OL,5,G0900 Classic Home and Away
OL,6,     FThe story of the Fletcher family
OL,7,     Ffrom the very beginning. Tom and
OL,8,     FPippa foster five children and buy
OL,9,     Fa run-down caravan park in Summer
OL,10,     FBay in order to keep their family
OL,11,     Ftogether.
OL,12,G1100 Classic Home and Away
OL,13,     FFrank's clash with Fisher
OL,14,     Fthreatens to make school-life
OL,15,     Fdifficult for the Fletcher kids.
OL,16,     FFloss's attempts to avert the
OL,17,     Fdeath foretold by the Tarot cards
OL,18,     Fseem to have been in vain.
